        "original_id": "580795f1-e509-5df1-91c4-867f9f357790",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Sunday Life\n- People: Louise Minchin, Colin Jackson\n- Organizations: BBC One\n- Topics: television programmes, athletics\n\nFacts:\n- Sunday Life was a British magazine and discussion television programme that began broadcasting on Sundays on BBC One on 20 April 2008.\n- Sunday Life was presented by Louise Minchin and Colin Jackson.\n- Sunday Life replaced the Heaven and Earth Show and was intended to focus on inspiring stories and thought-provoking discussion.\n- Colin Jackson was born on 18 February 1967 and is a Welsh former sprint and hurdling athlete who specialised in the 110 metres hurdles.",
